   "title": "Reading an electrocardiogram (ECG): the SAME ORDER every time",
   "lines": [
    "depolarization moving TOWARD a positive electrode writes an UPWARD deflection: leads, axis and infarct location all follow from that",
    "paper: 1 small box = 40 ms · 1 large box = 200 ms · 10 mm = 1 mV"
   ]
  },
